{
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x claw log [--since <time>] [--last <n>] [--all] [--debug]"
:
null
}
]
,
"--since"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"只输出指定时间以来的日志"
,
"en"
:
"Show logs since the given time"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"时间（例如 1h, 30m, 2d, 1751174400, '2025-06-29 12:00'）"
,
"en"
:
"Time (e.g. 1h, 30m, 2d, 1751174400, \"2025-06-29 12:00\")"
}
}
}
,
"--last"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"只输出最近 N 个顶层日志条目"
,
"en"
:
"Show only the last N top-level log entries"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"条目数（如 100）"
,
"en"
:
"Number of entries (e.g. 100)"
}
}
}
,
"--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"输出完整历史日志（默认只显示最近 50 条）"
,
"en"
:
"Output full history (default shows last 50 entries)"
}
}
,
"--debug"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示 claw 模块的 debug 日志（默认隐藏）"
,
"en"
:
"Show claw module debug logs (hidden by default)"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"日志包含所有 IM 平台的消息处理和心跳记录。\n默认显示最近 50 条日志，并接入实时 tail。\n支持多行日志条目（如 Agent 输出）。\n默认会隐藏 `D|claw:` 的 debug 日志，使用 --debug 可显示全部。\n心搏日志带有 [HB] 前缀，便于区分。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Logs include message processing and heartbeat records for all IM platforms.\nShows the last 50 log entries by default, then follows live output.\nSupports multi-line entries (e.g. Agent output).\n`D|claw:` debug logs are hidden by default; use --debug to show them.\nHeartbeat logs are prefixed with [HB] for easy identification.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 实时查看最近 50 条日志，排查最近的消息处理或心跳问题"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View the last 50 log entries in real time to troubleshoot recent message handling or heartbeat issues"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log --since 30m"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 查看最近 30 分钟的日志"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View logs from the last 30 minutes"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log --last 100"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 查看最近 100 条日志条目"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View the last 100 log entries"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log --all"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 查看完整历史日志"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View full historical logs"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log --debug"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 查看完整日志，包括 claw debug 信息"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View full logs including claw debug information"
}
]
}

